WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.212
Let's meet some shapes. This is a circle. It is round, with no corners.

00:06.662 --> 00:12.305
This is a square. It has four sides that are the same, and four corners.

00:12.755 --> 00:17.352
This is a triangle. It has three sides and three corners.

00:17.802 --> 00:24.002
Shapes can be different sizes. This circle is big. This circle is small.

00:24.452 --> 00:28.840
Circle, square, triangle. Look for them all around you.

00:29.290 --> 00:35.974
Now you try. Look around the room. Can you find a circle, a square and a triangle?

00:35.974 --> 00:37.441
Point to each one.
